{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105889","id":2487335522,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UQbpi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105889","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105889.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105889.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105889","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105889/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105889/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105889/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/379b7b3005f11bfd5bcdcad33af0971f2189871f","number":105889,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Use Radiance as Background render mode to sky shaders","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`render_mode use_radiance_as_background;` will make the sky render its background using the radiance map that is generated for reflections. This is an optimization that makes the sky rendering faster, especially on low-end GPUs limited by their fragment shading rate (which is common on mobile). The benefit is especially noticeable on demanding sky shaders, as they will skip all demanding computations for rendering the background.\r\n\r\nThe downside is that the background's resolution will depend on the radiance map's size configured in the Environment properties. Its update rate also depends on the chosen update mode, with the real-time update mode allowing for real-time updates at the cost of a fixed 256×256 resolution.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/88394.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_radiance_as_background.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19950533/test_radiance_as_background.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\nRadiance as Background OFF | Radiance as Background ON\r\n-|-\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20486423-c124-4684-831c-a50985ea4b9e) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5977a19-a305-4f50-b1fd-f4d81205aea4)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 42)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### NVIDIA\r\n\r\nType | Radiance as Background OFF | Radiance as Background ON\r\n-|-|-\r\nForward+, 3840×2160 | 3385 FPS (0.29 mspf) | 3549 FPS (0.28 mspf)\r\nMobile, 3840×2160 | 4210 FPS (0.23 mspf) | 5104 FPS (0.19 mspf)\r\n\r\n### Software rendering on CPU (Lavapipe)\r\n\r\nType | Radiance as Background OFF | Radiance as Background ON\r\n-|-|-\r\nForward+, 1152×648 | 150 FPS (6.66 mspf) | 159 FPS (6.28 mspf)\r\nMobile, 1152×648 | 193 FPS (5.18 mspf) | 214 FPS (4.67 mspf)\r\nForward+, 3840×2160 | 26 FPS (38.46 mspf) | 32 FPS (31.25 mspf)\r\nMobile, 3840×2160 | 30 FPS (33.33 mspf) | 40 FPS (25.00 mspf)\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [ ] Fix shader compilation in Compatibility. It seems `SAMPLER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_CLAMP` (along with other samplers used in the same shader) aren't defined in GLES3 (they are not present anywhere else in `drivers/gles3/`). See also my PR comment in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/10905 which is tangentially related.\r\n- [ ] Add a project setting to force using the radiance as background on all sky shaders, similar to the existing project setting that forces vertex shading on all materials. This can be used as a `mobile` feature tag override for performance reasons.\r\n- [ ] Consider disabling debanding in the cubemap pass in Forward+ to avoid performing double debanding (both at the cubemap texture level and at the sky level). I had initially done this, but this is not sufficient in Mobile (there will still be a fair amount of banding in the cubemap texture itself).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.gi